    "text": "By Jennifer Singh, KATU ,\n4 hours ago GRESHAM, Ore. (KATU) — The Gresham-Barlow School District will be introducing its proposed budget for the 2026-2027 school year during tonight’s budget committee meeting. The proposed budget comes just days after the district announced where cuts are likely to be made to help close a $10 million budget deficit for the upcoming school year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
